>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `remove_solver`

``` hol4
simpLib.remove_solver : string -> simpset -> simpset
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Removes a named solver from a simpset.

`remove_solver name ss` removes the solvers named `name` from both the
safe and the unsafe solvers of `ss`.

### Failure

Never fails. Returns `ss` if it has no solver `name`.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val decide = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE} : Traverse.ssolver;
>>_ val ss = simpLib.add_unsafe_solver decide bool_ss;
>>+ SIMP_CONV (simpLib.remove_solver "decide" ss)
      [arithmeticTheory.LESS_MOD] “x MOD (x + 1)”;
```

### See also

[`simpLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpLib.add_safe_solver`](#simpLib.add_safe_solver).
